Datasets for the paper "Chiral atom-centered scalar triple products for predicting enantiomer elution order in HPLC" by Alexandre V. Costa, Abdulwahab Hussein and Joao Aires-de-Sousa

The datasets are described in the paper. The test set compounds are listed first in each file.

The ADH dataset is derived from the source data of the publication Xu H, Lin J, Zhang D, Mo F (2023) Retention time prediction for chromatographic enantioseparation by quantile geometry-enhanced graph neural network. Nat Commun 14:3095. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-023-38853-3. The processed data was used from https://github.com/jairesdesousa/chiraldlsv

The CROWNPACK datasets were obtained from the publication Galvin C, Nagai K, Kaneko Y, Yuki S (2023) ChemRxiv. https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2023-1nfxl

The Lux datasets were obtained from the publication Imre A, Dombi G, Dobó M, Mhammad A, Ferencz E, Balogh B, Vincze A, Szabó ZI, Balogh GT, Rácz A, Tóth G (2025) Anal Chim Acta 1379:344733. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.aca.2025.344733
